5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's figure this out so we can all be cozy without worrying about the cost. I want to know how we've been doing so far!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree we need a new system. However, we should look at the actual data from the past year before deciding on a new split.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if there's a way to make it super easy! I don't want anyone spending all their free time doing boring math.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. We need to see if the current burden is actually uneven or if we're just guessing based on rumors.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I think we should look at the history of how we've handled payments. It's not just about the amount, but how we've dealt with it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, I'm with you! A template would be awesome. But I also want to know if some rooms are just naturally colder than others.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, that's a point, but we first need to see the total costs. I'm interested in the actual statements and any potential installation costs for changes.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, that sounds like a lot of work! I want to see how other houses do it. Maybe they have a secret trick!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, ""secret tricks"" aren't a strategy. I'll look into the payment logs and the actual statements to see who's actually paying what.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree with @Shunichi on the logs. I also want to see the payment history from when the last rooms were filled.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm still thinking about the heating! I'll check the sunlight and heating needs for each room. It's important to be fair about that!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to check out that reconciliation template! If it's a magic tool, it'll save us so much time!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll also check the plug-in monitor readings. If we're going to talk about ""carrying"" others, we need hard numbers on electricity usage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
